222
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,550
You can barely tell.

223
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,110
He's still so thin.

224
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,350
There's no extra fat on his face.

225
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:50,190
And now he seems

226
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:51,190
really relaxed.

227
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:52,950
He seems to be doing great.

228
00:06:53,250 --> 00:06:55,850
What's your first impression
of Ding Chengxin,

229
00:06:55,850 --> 00:06:56,900
the newest member of the team?

230
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,390
Yeah, I've seen

231
00:06:58,400 --> 00:07:00,550
Ding Chengxin on

232
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,550
a dance show before.

233
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:03,110
(Hehe)
I think he's a great dancer.

234
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,270
I love dancing too,

235
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,630
so I knew quite a bit about him.

236
00:07:06,060 --> 00:07:08,780
How was it interacting

237
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:09,880
with the other NPCs?

238
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:12,670
Junzi Ruyu,

239
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:13,390
He Wenjun,

240
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:14,670
and I met while filming

241
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:15,750
My Senior Brother Is Too Steady.

242
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:17,150
So we already knew each other.

243
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,630
And

244
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:20,670
he's still as funny as ever.

245
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,270
Being around him

246
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:22,430
is really easy.

247
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:23,230
With someone

248
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,750
who does comedy all the time,

249
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:26,190
you learn a lot.

250
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:27,590
And Yan Reason

251
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:30,190
