254
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,190
She's more like a northern girl.

255
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:34,790
And her fingers are so long.

256
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,030
Her hands are seriously huge.

257
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,230
I think they're even bigger than mine.

258
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:39,710
And she has manicures too. So unfair.

259
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:42,310
They're both really talkative,

260
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:44,070
so hanging out backstage
was a lot of fun.

261
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:46,000
(Dong Jiaqi as big eater vendor)
It's your first time on The Truth.

262
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,000
How was interacting with the team?

263
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:51,470
It was really special.

264
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,510
First, getting to meet

265
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:55,310
all these celebrities up close

266
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:57,150
was a rare opportunity.

267
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,110
And also,

268
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,350
everyone

269
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,430
was just playing games

270
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:03,030
and keeping things relaxed

271
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,110
