272
00:08:05,190 --> 00:08:06,980
Which player stood out most?

273
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:10,830
Probably Jin Jing.

274
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:14,590
I was pretty surprised

275
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:17,150
because when she came to my stall,

276
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:19,070
she recognized me right away.

277
00:08:21,300 --> 00:08:22,940
(Happily saying hi)

278
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,550
Hi!

279
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:24,910
What?

280
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:26,910
You know her?

281
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,230
Yeah, she was

282
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,230
on The Divine Dish as a chef.

283
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:33,350
So I was pretty surprised.

284
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:35,350
I thought

285
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:38,549
no one would recognize me.

286
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:39,990
But she knew me instantly.

287
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:43,870
(So happy)
So yeah, that really

288
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:44,750
stuck with me.

289
00:08:45,860 --> 00:08:48,600
Tiffany, tell us
about the dish you made.

290
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:51,630
For this dish,

291
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:53,670
I made

292
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:55,190
mini roujiamo.

293
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:57,190
They're bite-sized pork buns.

294
00:08:58,160 --> 00:09:00,270
I brought them

295
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:02,550
here from Xi'an.

296
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:04,150
Back in Xi'an,

297
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:07,910
I slow-cooked the pork

298
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:11,110
with over a dozen spices.

299
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,630
Then I made

300
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:14,150
(Big bite)
a bite-sized

301
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:17,270
baijimo bun to hold it.

302
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:21,750
It's a really popular Xi'an specialty.

303
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,680
How was filming The Truth

304
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:25,510
different from your past shows?

305
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:28,310
This time we filmed outdoors,

306
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,790
which was something

307
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:32,030
I'd never

308
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:33,470
done before.

309
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:36,270
And there were the costumes.

310
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:38,150
Believe it or not,

311
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:40,310
this was my first time wearing one.

312
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,830
It was really fun and unique.

313
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:47,550
The outdoor sets were amazing too.

314
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:50,350
Plus, filming at night gave it

315
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:51,710
this creepy street vibe.

316
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:54,550
Everything really blew me away.

317
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:55,070
Very unique.

318
00:09:56,010 --> 00:09:57,700
(Lin Tan as Master Gui)
Back for your second time on The Truth.

319
00:09:57,700 --> 00:09:58,860
Does it feel different?

320
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:01,350
(Played An Yi in The Truth 4 EP01)
This is our Chairman An Yi.

321
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:03,190
I'm much more used to it now.

322
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,030
It feels like coming home.

323
00:10:05,030 --> 00:10:05,580
(The Truth family)

324
00:10:05,900 --> 00:10:07,060
Did anything funny happen

325
00:10:07,060 --> 00:10:08,760
during filming?

326
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,430
The funniest thing

327
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,430
was last time,

328
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:12,590
when I argued with Jin Jing.

329
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:13,670
I genuinely had no idea

330
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:14,790
(The Truth 4 EP02 Part 2)
what she'd say next.

331
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:15,870
I'd prepared a lot,

332
00:10:15,880 --> 00:10:17,270
and I'm sure she had too.

333
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:18,030
But we probably

334
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:19,150
prepared totally different things.

335
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:20,710
So the argument got more chaotic,

336
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,110
but it turned out

337
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,670
really funny and dramatic.

338
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:24,510
I thought it worked great.

339
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,190
I really didn't know

340
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,630
what she'd say next.

341
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:28,790
We just kept firing back at each other.

342
00:10:28,800 --> 00:10:30,230
After it aired,

343
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:32,270
I watched the clip myself.

344
00:10:32,280 --> 00:10:34,870
People seemed to really like it.

345
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:35,780
(Thanks)
Thank you, everyone.

346
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,650
(Sui Xin as a villager)
During your interaction,

347
00:10:37,650 --> 00:10:39,470
(Kong Pengrui as Lucky Draw Stall owner)
which player stood out most?

348
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:41,310
The one who stood out most

349
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,590
was Jin Jing.

350
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:45,150
She tried to steal my money right away.

351
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:47,030
She told Ding Chengxin to rob me.

352
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:48,630
(Caught her)
I saw right through it.

353
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:50,630
Jin Jing stood out to me too.

354
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:52,790
(Just took them)
She even swiped two of mine at the end.

355
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:53,750
Let's go.

356
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:54,990
She robbed me blind.

357
00:10:54,990 --> 00:10:55,270
Yeah.

358
00:10:56,270 --> 00:10:57,480
During your interaction,

359
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:59,370
(Yang Zhibo as fortune teller)
Who stood out most?

360
00:11:00,310 --> 00:11:00,990
It

361
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:03,070
was Yang Chaoyue

362
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:04,030
and Jin Jing.

363
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:05,870
While I was fortune-telling,

364
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:07,430
they stood beside me

365
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:09,550
holding fans, ready to smack me.

366
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,670
They wanted to hit me.

367
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:12,990
Where did Yan Reason go?

368
00:11:12,990 --> 00:11:14,580
(Say that again, I dare you)

369
00:11:15,220 --> 00:11:16,820
(Behaving now, please spare me)

370
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:20,310
So those two really stuck with me.

371
00:11:20,850 --> 00:11:23,270
Who's the best detective in your eyes?

372
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,870
I'd say

373
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:26,510
Zhou Keyu.

374
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:27,910
When they were asking questions,

375
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:29,830
he kept helping everyone

376
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:31,110
stay on track.

377
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:33,310
They went down a few wrong paths,

378
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:35,070
but he kept helping everyone

379
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:36,190
find the right direction.

380
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:37,230
So to me,

381
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,830
he's the strongest detective.

382
00:11:39,450 --> 00:11:40,280
During this shoot,

383
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:42,280
(Liu Yi as the little boy)
what moment stood out most?

384
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:44,750
For me, it was probably

385
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:46,230
all the screaming.

386
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:48,310
Like Yang Chaoyue

387
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,870
and Ding Chengxin.

388
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:51,830
Their screams were seriously intense.

389
00:11:51,830 --> 00:11:53,000
(Screams everywhere)

390
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,310
I'll never forget them.

391
00:11:54,310 --> 00:11:56,500
What would you say
to the players you scared?

392
00:11:56,920 --> 00:11:57,590
Don't be scared.

393
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:59,990
Honestly, I was more scared
than you guys.

394
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:03,630
=The Truth (Season 4)=

395
00:12:03,630 --> 00:12:04,660
(SVIP updates Wed & Thu at noon)

396
00:12:04,670 --> 00:12:05,740
(VIP updates next day at noon,
one week early)
